5:T4a7,These genuine leather motorcycle gloves are the ideal choice for discerning bikers who value protection and functionality. The outer layer is made of durable, abrasion-resistant cowhide leather, ensuring longevity and protection in all weather conditions. The gloves are equipped with shock-absorbing protectors on the knuckles and finger joints, providing additional protection in the event of an impact.


Details & Features:

Material: 100% genuine leather – particularly durable and long-lasting
Ankle protection: Hard shell protector with ventilation slots for optimal protection and air circulation
Finger protection: Reinforced finger zones with additional impact protection
Palm: Anti-slip inserts for optimal grip – even when wet.
Touchscreen compatible: Index finger with touch function for operating smartphones and navigation devices
Closure: Wide Velcro closure at the wrist for a perfect fit and quick adjustment
Comfort: Elastic inserts and an ergonomic cut ensure comfortable wear and freedom of movement.

Area of ​​application:

Ideal for sporty tours, city driving, and longer trips. The gloves offer a secure riding experience with maximum comfort.6:T6c1,The product is a particularly robust motorcycle glove for bikers who want to combine maximum safety and a tactical look in one product.
Made from high-quality, abrasion-resistant cowhide leather, it offers reliable all-around protection – ideal for sporty riders, touring, city riding, and demanding use.

The H11's most striking feature is its robust hard-shell knuckle protector with a protective glass effect, which reliably absorbs impact energy.
Combined with reinforced padding on the palm, fingers, and thumb, as well as grip pads, the H11 ensures excellent control, even at high speeds or during rapid maneuvers.

Thanks to its ergonomic design, semi-flexible finger inserts and soft inner padding, the glove offers a high level of comfort – without compromising on safety.

Details & Features:
Material: Genuine cowhide leather – extremely robust, durable, abrasion-resistant
Ankle protection: Large hard shell with high-strength protective glass look
Finger protectors: Additional protector pads for increased safety
Palm reinforcement: Anti-slip inserts & shock-absorbing padding
Design: Powerful tactical black with high-strength elements
Closure: Sturdy hook-and-loop fastener for a secure fit on the wrist.
Comfort: Ergonomically designed, soft lining, flexible finger zones
Fit: Snug fit for precise handling and optimal control
Weather resistance: Smooth leather, moisture-resistant, easy to clean
Area of ​​application:
Perfectly suited for sport riders , touring riders , commuters , cruisers , naked bikers , and riders who prioritize maximum safety.
The product combines a tactical design with superior stability – ideal for anyone seeking protection, grip, and a powerful look in a premium glove.7:T514,These high-quality motorcycle gloves impress with a powerful, clean all-black design, combined with maximum protection and outstanding comfort.
Made from strong, abrasion-resistant cowhide leather, the gloves offer a durable and reliable layer of protection. Integrated knuckle protectors and reinforced padding on the palm, fingers, and thumb ensure increased safety during every riding maneuver.

The soft inner structure, ergonomic fit, and elastic wrist cuff offer a comfortable feel – even on longer rides. At the same time, the smooth, durable surface allows for precise and direct control of the throttle, brake, and clutch.

Details & Features:
Material: 100% genuine cowhide leather – extremely robust, durable and abrasion-resistant
Ankle protection: Integrated hard-shell protectors for optimal impact protection
Design: Elegant, all-black look with discreet safety seams
Palm reinforcement: Padded protective surfaces increase grip and safety.
Thumb padding: Additional safety zones for critical contact points
Closure: Secure, adjustable Velcro closure at the wrist.
Comfort: Ergonomically shaped, soft inner material, flexible movement zones
Fit: Snug fit for precise handling and excellent control
Weather-resistant: Smooth leather absorbs hardly any moisture and is easy to clean.8:T66e,The product combines sporty design with high protection and first-class comfort.
The robust construction from genuine cowhide leather ensures excellent abrasion resistance, while the striking black and blue look gives the glove a dynamic racing character.

The integrated hard-shell knuckle protector offers maximum impact protection, and the reinforced padding on the palm, thumb, and outer hand provides additional protection. The grippy inner surfaces allow for optimal control of the accelerator, brake, and clutch.

With their ergonomic fit, flexible stretch zones, and soft inner padding, the H21 gloves offer a particularly comfortable yet precise riding experience. The touchscreen-compatible index finger ensures that smartphones and navigation devices can be operated with ease.

Details & Features:
Material: 100% genuine cowhide leather – robust, durable, abrasion-resistant
Ankle protection: Integrated hard shell protector in glossy black
