Touch function: Index finger with touchscreen compatibility
Flex zones: Accordion stretch areas for improved mobility
Closure: Strong, adjustable Velcro closure at the wrist
Fit: Ergonomic, flexible and close-fitting
Area of ​​application:
Ideal for sport riders, touring riders, naked bikes, streetfighters, and city riding.
The H21 offers reliable protection, excellent control, and a striking design – perfect for those who combine performance with style.9:T65d,The product is a high-quality motorcycle glove made of genuine cowhide leather, designed for bikers seeking the perfect balance of safety, comfort, and grip.
Its deep black design is elegant and understated, while the integrated knuckle protectors and reinforced padding on the palm, fingers, and thumb offer optimal protection.

The flexible stretch zone above the wrist ensures excellent mobility and a comfortable, snug fit. Thanks to the soft inner padding and ergonomic finger design, the H10 offers exceptional comfort even on long tours.

The non-slip inserts on the palm of the hand guarantee maximum control over the accelerator, brake and clutch – especially important for sporty or dynamic driving styles.

Details & Features:
